
# The command LINEARBUILD_EXPORT_BUILD_SETTINGS(...) was used by
# @PROJECT_NAME@ to generate this file.  As of LinearBuild 2.8 the
# functionality of this command has been dropped as it was deemed
# harmful (confusing users by changing their compiler).

# LinearBuild 2.6 and below do not support loading their equivalent of this
# file if it was produced by a newer version of LinearBuild.  LinearBuild 2.8 and
# above simply do not load this file.  Therefore we simply error out.
message(FATAL_ERROR
  "This @PROJECT_NAME@ was built by LinearBuild @LINEARBUILD_VERSION@, but this is LinearBuild "
  "${LINEARBUILD_MAJOR_VERSION}.${LINEARBUILD_MINOR_VERSION}.${LINEARBUILD_PATCH_VERSION}.  "
  "Please upgrade LinearBuild to a more recent version.")
